==Battleground==
*20 [[Ghost Doge]]s (400%) spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
At first glance, this might seem like a fearsome Zombie stage, but this can essentially be treated like a regular EoC Outbreak stage. Meatshields and general attackers can still handle this stage. Additionally, any strong wave attackers or anti-zombies can help make this a breeze. If you can handle the outbreaks from EoC2, this should be like any of those.

